      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "The Player's dark sentence-card variant; display fonts fall back locally in this documentation preview.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-sentence\"><div class=\"ds-speaker\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 11h4l6-5v16l-6-5H5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M19 10q3 4 0 8m4-12q6 8 0 16\"/></svg></div><p class=\"ds-sentence-text\">I opened the window to let in the morning air.</p><p class=\"ds-translation\">아침 공기를 들이려고 창문을 열었어요.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-sentence{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;padding:26px 20px;border:2px solid #344960;border-radius:16px;background:#192a3e;color:#f4f7fa}.ds-speaker{align-self:flex-start;padding:14px;border-radius:20px;background:#143953;color:#f4f7fa}.ds-speaker svg{display:block}.ds-sentence-text{margin:0;font-family:Nunito_800ExtraBold,ui-rounded,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:29px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2}.ds-translation{margin:0;color:#b8c7d8;font:500 18px/1.45 system-ui,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Learning-mode Choices",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "choice-selected",
      "description": "Radio-choice rows with text and symbols; these are settings choices, not a text-input field. The preview is a static selection sample.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-choices\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"진행 방식\"><button class=\"ds-choice ds-choice-selected\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"m7 12 3 3 7-7\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-choice-copy\"><span class=\"ds-choice-title\">직접 확인</span><span class=\"ds-choice-detail\">말한 뒤 버튼을 눌러 다음 사이클로.</span></span></button><button class=\"ds-choice\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-choice-copy\"><span class=\"ds-choice-title\">자동 진행</span><span class=\"ds-choice-detail\">말할 시간이 지나면 다음 사이클로.</span></span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-choices{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}.ds-choice{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;min-height:54px;padding:16px;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:14px;background:#ffffff;color:#4b4b4b;text-align:left}.ds-choice svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}.ds-choice-copy{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:0}.ds-choice-title{color:#042c60;font:700 17px/1.45 system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-choice-detail{color:#4b4b4b;font:500 14px/1.45 system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-choice-selected{border-color:#ff9600;background:#d7ffb8;color:#042c60}.ds-choice:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-choice:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #042c60;outline-offset:3px}.ds-choice:active{background:#f7f7f7}.ds-choice-selected:active{background:#d7ffb8}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sentence Progress",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "progress-track",
      "description": "A dark track with an illustrative 1-of-12 value. Runtime fill must come from confirmed state; this is not live data.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-progress-canvas\"><div class=\"ds-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"문장 진행 예시\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"12\" aria-valuenow=\"1\"><div class=\"ds-progress-fill\"><div class=\"ds-progress-highlight\"></div></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-progress-canvas{padding:16px;background:#101c2c}.ds-progress{height:16px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#344960}.ds-progress-fill{height:100%;width:8.333333%;border-radius:8px;background:#ffc800;padding-top:3px;padding-left:6px;padding-right:6px;box-sizing:border-box}.ds-progress-highlight{height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#ffffff;opacity:.3}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stage Identity",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stage-number",
      "description": "The stage numeral has minimum dimensions plus padding and can grow with text; the count is a static uncompleted example.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stage\"><span class=\"ds-stage-number\">1</span><div class=\"ds-stage-copy\"><span class=\"ds-stage-title\">Stage 1</span><span class=\"ds-stage-count\">0회 완료</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stage{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:20px;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:16px;background:#ffffff}.ds-stage-number{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;min-width:56px;min-height:56px;padding:10px;border-radius:20px;background:#ffc800;color:#042c60;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Nunito_800ExtraBold,ui-rounded,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2}.ds-stage-copy{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0}.ds-stage-title{color:#042c60;font-family:Nunito_800ExtraBold,ui-rounded,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2}.ds-stage-count{color:#4b4b4b;font:500 14px/1.45 system-ui,sans-serif}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Friendly spoken practice",
    "overview": "쇄도잉 makes spoken practice feel approachable through solid surfaces, rounded display lettering, original lesson artwork, and buttons that visibly depress. The owner-approved Duolingo-inspired direction supplies the Bee-yellow, Macaw-blue, navy, and white palette; 쇄도잉 uses the owner-supplied name, logo and icon.\n\nNative iPhone navigation and readable Korean and English organize this playful character around one clear next action. Crisp borders and generous spacing carry the hierarchy in both appearances. Encouragement comes from actual learning progress and plain, friendly language.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Solid, tactile controls with a flat bottom lip.",
      "Rounded English display type paired with system Korean and interface text.",
      "Original lesson artwork and restrained semantic color.",
      "Native navigation, scalable text, and truthful progress."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Readable Accent Rule",
        "body": "Use navy ink on Bee-yellow and Macaw-blue fills; use the appearance-specific heading and link colors on pale or dark surfaces.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Scale Rule",
        "body": "Scale custom text size and line height once with the current system font scale, without a text-size cap; allow text containers to grow.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Solid Press Rule",
        "body": "Reserve app-drawn shadows for the flat action-button lip. Pressing lowers the button face into that lip without moving surrounding layout.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the current semantic palette for light and dark appearances.",
      "Do preserve the raised button geometry and keep touch targets at least 44 points.",
      "Do let Korean and English wrap and let stage numerals grow with system text size.",
      "Do show selection with a checkmark and progress with numbers as well as color.",
      "Do derive progress and completion from confirmed learning state.",
      "Do keep original raster artwork with its prompt provenance."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't copy Duolingo characters or proprietary fonts, or invent reward/streak values instead of reading real local completion data.",
      "Don't use white labels on the bright Bee-yellow primary button.",
      "Don't draw a second filled button or shadow inside the native navigation-bar container.",
      "Don't truncate or cap text to preserve a fixed card or badge size.",
      "Don't introduce diffuse app-card shadows, glass panels, or decorative gradients into the solid interface.",
      "Don't announce routine saves or turn interrupted practice into completion."
    ]
  }
}
